<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first division matches on Saturday:</p>
<p>Heerenveen 2 (Korneev 15, Hansma 20) Utrecht 2 (Hernandez 18, Mols 56). Halftime 2-1. Attendance 13,550.</p>
<p>NAC Breda 2 (Abdellaoui 36, Arnold 55) Graafschap Doetinchem 1 (Van der Haar 71). 1-0. Attendance 11,984.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 0 Roda JC Kerkrade 1 (Ooijer 85)</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 4 (Marcelo 39, Nilis 74 pen, 83, Zenden 90) NEC</p>
<p>Nijmegen 1 (Van Eijkeren 48 pen 48). 1-0. Attendance 27,300.</p>
